From: Lapin UX <arnz.lee16@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:44:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: Windows 11-style lock and sign-in screens

Lock screen: big clock and date over the wallpaper; a click or key slides
to the sign-in panel (round picture, name, password, dimmed wallpaper,
network/battery/accessibility/power at the bottom right). The greeter
gets the same faces plus Windows' user list at the bottom left.
examples/lapin_preview shows both in a window.
